      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In the 1850s Scotch‑Irish and German pioneers cleared the Little Juniata valley for farms and mills, shaping the area’s early economy.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
